d recover the priceless relics and art pieces plundered from the occupied territories, using both real weapons and advanced prototypes. Capture enemy vehicles and take strategic positions to make sure you emerge victorious!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mission begins!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455330/extras/0b7b5c4e60d8a56b538947c7bc0522f1.avif?t=1785255422\" width=780 height=212 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will not be alone. The Dogs of War squad is ready to support you:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Captain Hamilton</strong> and his bomber Lady Hell, to destroy enemy positions or send supplies. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Irina Pavlichenko</strong>, the lethal Ukranian sniper.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jean-Claude Kunda</strong>, expert in sabotage and telecommunications.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coronel Barnsby</strong>, the tactician that will lead the operation from headquarters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455330/extras/04e938fd007fba9ee2ef105c1a1685a8.avif?t=1785255422\" width=780 height=212 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fusion of Genres: </strong>An explosive combination of run &amp; gun, platforming and video adventure with tactical and challenging missions, and with a good dose of cheeky humour!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Missions with high Replay Value: </strong>Enjoy 9 different missions, with very varied settings, enemies and ways of beating them. They will take on a tour through Berlin until you find the enemy's lair.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Historical Weapons and Vehicles:</strong> Use real weapons and advanced prototypes, caspture enemy vehicles and take strategic positions to secure victory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More than 50 Characters and Vehicles:</strong> Fight 8 epic final bosses and interact with more than 50 unique characters between enemies, NPCs and vehicles while you advance on your mission.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Carefully crafted Art: </strong>Enjoy a visual design that combines pixel art, 2D illustrations, 3D graphics and animations done frame by frame, designed traditionally. And as huge news, the main art for the game's cover was designed by the one and only Alfonso Azpiri!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cutscenes: </strong>Experience an intenese story about spies, commandos and mystery in World War II, narrated through incredible motion-comic scenes drawn and animated by hand.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Soundtrack:</strong> Lose yourself in the music of Chris Huelsbeck, creator of iconic soundtracks like Turrican. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration and Collectibles: </strong>Discover easter eggs, collect relics and art pieces to exhibit in the integrated museum, and unlock classified information with the TOP SECRET files.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reward System:</strong> Win medals and badges completing challenges and prove your worth in the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455330/extras/e603a141f55b9bc580ff934d3bcda15e.poster.avif?t=1785255422\" width=550 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455330/extras/e603a141f55b9bc580ff